  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Aaron Lukas said IARPA research programs would help build capabilities directly applicable to mission needs by bridging the technical gap between emerging solutions and successful application. In written answers, Lukas said the IC currently lags far behind the private sector and increasingly behind adversaries in adopting AI, citing current slowness in adopting AI to the intelligence business. He also said integrating emerging technologies such as AI, quantum computing, and autonomous systems to stay ahead of adversaries is a major challenge requiring ODNI leadership. Lukas stated that maintaining the IC’s technological edge in rapidly developing areas including AI requires a faster, more flexible, and agile R&D enterprise and improved collaboration with the private sector.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s5"
   ],
